*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : INT0007
*> PURPOSE : INTEREST TIERS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : R.T.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1989-03-15 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2003-11-04 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 346
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB INTNIGHT STEP080
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. INT0007.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    *> ACCOUNT TYPE S=SAVINGS C=CHECKING P=PREMIUM G=GOLD B=BUSINESS F=FIXED
    05 ACCT-TYPE          PIC X.
       88 ACCT-SAVINGS VALUE 'S'.
    *> CURRENT LEDGER BALANCE
    05 LEDGER-BAL         PIC 9(9)V99.
01 OUT-RECORD.
    05 INTEREST-RATE      PIC 9V9999 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM APPLY-INT-TIER
    DISPLAY "INTEREST-RATE=" INTEREST-RATE
    STOP RUN.
APPLY-INT-TIER.
    IF ACCT-TYPE = 'S' AND LEDGER-BAL >= 75000
        MOVE 0.0425 TO INTEREST-RATE
    *> MIDDLE SAVINGS TIER
    ELSE IF ACCT-SAVINGS
       AND LEDGER-BAL NOT LESS THAN 20000
        MOVE 0.0325 TO INTEREST-RATE
    *> BASE SAVINGS RATE
    ELSE IF ACCT-SAVINGS
        MOVE 0.0250 TO INTEREST-RATE
    ELSE
        MOVE 0.0050 TO INTEREST-RATE
    END-IF
    END-IF
    END-IF.
